            <h1 id="cs-title" class="cs-title">Dell Sales Chat: what we actually know</h1>
            <p class="cs-outcome cs-outcome--quiet">What Dell's in-house AI tool for sellers is, what it can and can't do, and what it might mean for our work. Public sources only.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="br-download">{{ button('Download PDF', pdf, '', 'pill') }}</div>
